"application":{"premise_bindings":[{"assumption_id":"scalar.paper_minimizer","binding_names":["gamma"],"rationale":"Attainment supplies gamma_0 minimizing the same manuscript Parisi functional. Full support is applied to this gamma_0; the landscape theorem then uses the Stieltjes support of that same minimizer.","supplier_id":"scalar.minimizer_attainment"},{"assumption_id":"scalar.paper_admissible","binding_names":["gamma"],"rationale":"The attained gamma_0 belongs to the same class U, so its admissibility accompanies its minimality. Pure zero-field SK and xi(t)=t^2/2 remain the fixed model; the common Gaussian covariance adjustment is retained in the landscape argument.","supplier_id":"scalar.minimizer_attainment"}],"rationale":"The long record applies ACZ Proposition 1 to the full-support minimizer and identifies its value using the attained Parisi formula. Attainment is supplied by the separately sourced scalar.minimizer_attainment node (and explained in the long record at #minimizer-attainment); it is not an extra caller premise of the landscape consequence. This records the ordinary same-witness application only. The external landscape theorem and the covariance correction remain necessary inputs; no cross-model Lean transport, checked substitution or formal acceptance is asserted.","remaining_assumption_ids":[],"shared_bindings":{"gamma":"one attained minimizer gamma_0 in the manuscript pure zero-field SK class U, used for full support and the support-point premise of the ACZ landscape theorem"},"source_span":{"end_line":3761,"source_id":"authored_long_comparisons_20261024","start_line":3686},"status":"authored"},"application_metadata_scope":"remaining_assumption_ids is authored historical metadata, not an effective obligation audit; path-local suppression may be lifted for retained formal dependencies.","derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:f22708f3180068944c06829213f78f6ecfb65ef34f6c8decded774b95a041d92/nodes/support.near_ground_pairs","id":"sh